  "title": "Garmin adds over a dozen more Guided Visual Approaches to aviation database lineup",
  "summary": "OLATHE, Kan./July 2, 2026 – Garmin (NYSE: GRMN) today announced additional runways and airports for Guided Visual Approaches, a growing database that provides lateral and vertical guidance for pilots flying visual approaches into challenging airports.1 Designed in collaboration with Hughes Aerospace, this latest update adds 18 new Guided Visual Approaches and 13 new airports – […]",
